%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as SQLite pager
  participant D as t.db (main)
  participant J as t.db-journal
  Note over S,J: BEGIN IMMEDIATE (OP_Transaction)
  S->>D: lock SHARED
  S->>D: read hdr 16B
  S->>D: lock RESERVED
  Note over S,J: INSERT (OP_Insert)
  S->>D: read page 2
  S->>J: open & write 512B hdr
  S->>J: save original page 2
  Note over S,J: COMMIT (vdbeCommit)
  S->>D: lock EXCLUSIVE
  S->>J: save original page 1
  S->>J: sync journal & dir .
  S->>J: write pg count & sync
  S->>D: write p1 & p2
  S->>D: sync t.db
  S->>J: close & unlink (COMMIT POINT)
  S->>D: unlock NONE
